{"version":1,"key":"card:49","content":{"id":49,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"如何不追踪某些文件？","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c4e50a68-fa3b-4480-b428-60f88edfcb1a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"如果你还没有追踪这个文件，直接在 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":".gitignore","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 把他添加进去就行了","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8ce739ee-99ab-4979-963f-1b1bf1e2e4e5","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"# .gitignore\nprivate.key","collabId":"1b7304f8-30d6-428c-ac4c-003e70465fc9","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"22152719-4871-415b-8c1f-c5f88bce3e96","language":"","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"c93a9008-3dbb-48b6-befd-17e3521b4e55"},{"children":[{"text":"但是如果不小心追踪了某个不应该追踪的文件，比如密钥，这个时候只改 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":".gitignore","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 是不行的，需要使用 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"git rm","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"193121cf-5367-4835-9b6b-c87e4b10fbdc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"git rm -r --cached private.key","collabId":"66ff4165-f691-4a7b-a4c1-81660ef8b97d","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"bbd6cc3e-389f-4f3c-b8a8-7f639919d5bd","language":"shell","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"b2cd20dc-304c-49a5-9877-803e731bf6cb"},{"children":[{"text":"然后把 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"private.key","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 添加到 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":".gitignore","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 中，然后重新提交就不会被追踪了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0c473232-956a-4504-a311-6c13173c0dc7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["Git/技巧","技巧/Git"],"createTime":1689000244636,"updateTime":1793532515698,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532515698}}